      <activity id="b87cc4f0-59b1-5860-8495-ff2b91e86816" activityNameId="3675cb24-374c-536b-a631-3523af1db3ea" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Biogas purification, to methane, 99 vol-%, membrane technology process</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Biogas purification, to methane, 99 vol-%, membrane technology process
Inventory refers to 1 m3 of methane. Electricity consumption and emissions represent the raw gas compression, H2S removal, gas conditioning and methane enrichment of biogas.  Infrastructure expenditures are included employing generic data for facilities of a chemical plant as approximation.;
UUID: e5565e65-b8bd-3f37-8db8-0aea66514e9d
Emissions due to leakage and purification of biogas. Input of energy and auxiliary materials. Biogas input excluded from the dataset.
Location: Data represents conditions of biogas purification plants in Switzerland
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by factories 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e5565e65-b8bd-3f37-8db8-0aea66514e9d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
